OL,3,GNEWSAGame show winner to invest in
OL,4,Atown's good causes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who won #120,000 on Michael
OL,7,FMcIntyre's The Wheel has pledged to
OL,8,Fdonate a chunk of his winnings to good
OL,9,Fcauses in his community.
OL,11,FPaul Lees, from Gosport, won the BBC
OL,12,Fgame show on Saturday after correctly
OL,13,Fanswering a question about Ancient
OL,14,FGreece.
OL,16,FA "huge fan" of the show, he said he
OL,17,Fsigned up to mark his 40th birthday,
OL,18,Fbut had never expected to walk away
OL,19,Fwith the top prize.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
