OL,3,GNEWSAGame show winner to invest in
OL,4,Atown's good causes
OL,5,
OL,6,FLees, who runs One Box of Fudge, a
OL,7,Fbusiness that donates money to Gosport,
OL,8,Ftold BBC Radio Solent part of the money
OL,9,Fwould be donated to local charities and
OL,10,Fgood causes.
